<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>本班成绩 · 校园测评</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/school/school.css"/></head><body><main class="wrap"><header class="nav"><div class="brand">📈 本班考试与练习成绩</div><div><a href="/school/admin">返回教师管理</a></div></header><div class="section-head"><div><h1 id="resultTitle">正在读取成绩</h1><p id="resultSubtitle" class="subtitle"></p></div><button class="light" id="exportBtn" disabled>导出当前班级 CSV</button></div><div id="resultError" class="note hidden"></div><div id="resultCards" class="card adminCard"></div><div class="card adminCard"><h2>学生成绩</h2><div class="tablewrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>账号</th><th>姓名</th><th>班级</th><th>进度</th><th>得分</th><th>更新时间</th></tr></thead><tbody id="resultStudents"></tbody></table></div></div><div class="card adminCard"><h2>逐题正确情况</h2><div class="tablewrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>题号</th><th>题目</th><th>已答人数</th><th>答对</th><th>答错/部分得分</th><th>正确率</th></tr></thead><tbody id="resultQuestions"></tbody></table></div></div><p class="note">数据只统计通过校园账号系统作答、且当前仍属于本人任教班级的学生；旧版匿名成绩不计入。本页面每次手动刷新可取得新成绩。</p></main><script defer src="/school/teacher-results.js"></script></body></html>
